<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY 46 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY 46 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Australia by 46 runs in the third one day international on Wednesday to take a 2-1 lead in the seven-match series.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 245-8 in 50 overs; Australia 199 all out in 44.5 overs.</p>
